 Add Controller_Joystick * Level 2.2 Add Gear 3 (90%?)</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="JS.PN`4O^#gNBk:M@x)B"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="7J%V2GhIqPR-%TlwzH`B"><field name="TEXT">Basic Comment_Colors Usage:: Black: Very Big Picture, Blue: Big Picture, Green: Following Block_Code Moddable, Orange: Question/TODO, Magenta: Special Multi-Purpose </field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="Cc#*sm/zb#k@BkaO@B?{"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="oz4`F;E,KdM=p.tEv./r"><field name="TEXT">micro:bit Ver2 Warning during Download is Ignorable Yet Courteously Helpful</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="h.)2N(|$a.Q:YY?hI(=,"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="R3[eK^PUQhWLkOyrTcr~"><field name="TEXT">'if_then' mini-stacks useful for modular 3-D code select/duplicate/move/delete</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="oTq:{N-f$mDW:*3K_ZS0"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="D1if]^fj8L-x${MEq5e2"><field name="TEXT">Light_Gray Functions non-editable (backend staff-use code only)</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="M!~CKU^ShVNXpZisJY*D"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="W|dGNtMsqZFgLUK.np,}"><field name="TEXT">For Group_CHannel_# (Bot_Id): Propose: 1-10 Staff Use, 11-99 Student Use</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="}2y:L)D8UWtuq1hQ5RMJ"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="+LY~}?u@|-a^ND^I+vW,"><field name="TEXT">SW Reset: Long_Press Logo for 3 sec min</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="5-/%[`^MciMeT%qT`pBm"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="!U,:ya1CB:Y]=3%QKCFv"><field name="TEXT">Built-in Diagnostic Test: Short_Press Logo for 1 sec max</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="9|_)1;oqtLupn)6[Gp5J"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="]1R3WHIWi901c~Lq22$j"><field name="TEXT">'Blocks' Window homes 'on start'_stack as top_left corner of editor_screen, until 'on start' is moved below, then next stack to right presides</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_3_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="g4F^-)(5;zRn~O.ybj(="><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="^wGVZI+*vIz{SO?wa^Y*"><field name="TEXT">All These Levels are Intermediate Level Coding due to Networking Pairing Involved.  Basic Diagnostic Servo_Motors (Autonomoous) is Beginner Level.</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_3_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="Qf+oi*t{dnII%@73ySsf"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="`Uwp);#![)o2j1F1`Ur;"><field name="TEXT">This Intermediate Level Network_Pairing has 1sec_Lag Response Time; The Other Advanced Level Network_Pairing has Real_Time Response Time.</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_3_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="~|+I8DiXo;9:4~6VyQWh"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="YOo;L24|c*R8aDrjYufh"><field name="TEXT">For Level 1, can keep 'Forward: set manual_servo_motors' Block functional, yet reset to 0 all other 'set manual_servo_motors' Blocks for Discovery Learning</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_3_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="rrTRx*d9|uJ/5/hJ7PW0"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="v![QGa82^6dkz:!FT$[O"><field name="TEXT">If duplicate stacks exist, then the highest stack is active and others are non_active</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="BWAh9I{VpEu]io?w90)5"><value name="IF0"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="5z+E]Q`C,{4AG@BE1U2$"><field name="BOOL">FALSE</field></shadow></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="quest_Note_6_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Big_Func" id="Mo$i#7`UIi=F2wgAZ8lB"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="9OV(x2sK@Hbf07i}IL)1"><field name="TEXT">Staff: Important Notes</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="YR,}$Y+nzOaI+1D3m_uI"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="Q6Q=[B`CuH,!~$5ybv//"><field name="TEXT">Upon open file, Editor zooms in on closest stack to right of original_origin from project_creation</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="}|(*!w;+K4Lerklq)lLA"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="+mVl-V`fq`{+6DU-5Ja="><field name="TEXT">Semantic Naming prefers '_' vs. '-' since latter can be conufused with minus_sign</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="CYFsBmM+%@6KM{m^x?;k"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="j,fb8.y89doI(Jw6O0Fv"><field name="TEXT">'every 360000 ms' (1 hour) Stacks can be ignored, esp w/ 'if false' embedded</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="W9G}21!/)#U#_9J68`z2"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="BgrN-sv:vb%]ylIeIS|9"><field name="TEXT">Avoid using 'show leds' Block since will cause lag &amp; degrade real-time response</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="BBM3Z(^Y:p+W#?|SSAw7"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="=bUs3M}S:RxqDKy|*9XK"><field name="TEXT">Seems like 'signficant' changes to JavaScript can activate 'format code', rearrange stacks to original position</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="vD%#KSjT+}hO,c%bF%|p"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="|yApS;_Es2^@ATuf76UU"><field name="TEXT">Important 'system' variables are 1) _system_Hw_DeviceType__* (Hw=Hardware) and 2) _system_Sw_ModeState__* (Sw=Software)</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="3P0Q$zp31RRu1^o75R_;"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="q%P^![ZDS+(e|-^VB2?U"><field name="TEXT">If Buttons C-F for Gears/Misc, Maybe 'Logo Up/Down' for 'Servo_Arm Up/Down'</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="x=JJxT{sk^!k5`{3R^#t"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="_TNYU:Jf:=2myi5oD$sK"><field name="TEXT">'Rotatedisplay' could be used on Bot's Led_Screen, but causes light flickering on bottom row, so maybe avoid</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="9aj-mbkZtm8IT0a6(-7E"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="p@J_3f(7{%3AbkRVdhKN"><field name="TEXT">Reliable/Faster Response If Screen_Led_Graphics After Important Action Blocks Above</field></shadow></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="X:hgOqKc%]]9gP~vGFz|"><value name="IF0"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="7i9JpYiamT[6C|/I^?r1"><field name="BOOL">FALSE</field></shadow></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="quest_Note_3_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="wML}iu@?75)qktyQPV;P"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id=".?Ja0A1~2.G,A{lL_Y_u"><field name="TEXT">Main upgrade from Lv1 to Lv2 is replacing cpu_laggy 'show leds' block with cpu_fast 'plox x _ y _' block, such as below: </field></shadow></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="OiXWh0+(8I!|4WH-.p6o"><mutation elseif="4" else="1"></mutation><value name="IF0"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="|]/ucvj]SCfsn%2W#HlS"><field name="BOOL">FALSE</field></sh